From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:13:24 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Meridian: agents get a feature guide and pin tabs into a
 folder

meridian_guide (read-only) returns a short guide to what Meridian can do,
each line checked against the code. organize_tab's pin takes a folder name:
the space's folder of that name, made on top the first time (a Pinterest
moodboard, a reading list).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
---
